  "instance_name": "power_of_christ",
  "label": "Christian theological concept of divine omnipotence",
  "description": "The phrase 'power of Christ' refers to the belief in Christianity that Jesus Christ possesses divine authority, power, and influence over all creation, including moral, spiritual, and physical realms. This concept is central to Christian doctrine and is often invoked in religious contexts to assert the supremacy of God's will and authority. The meme uses this phrase to create a humorous contrast with the cat's apparent indifference, implying that even divine power cannot compel the cat to comply.",
